5 - Files
    -----

    L002_00__Premises.v

      Imports `M001_95_API` and defines the premise vocabulary:
      `CodingOfSLambdaDerivability`, `DiagonalFormula`, `MirrorConsistent`,
      `SLambdaConsistent`, `AsIF`, `OperationalAdmissible`, `Escape`,
      `LocalAuthority`, `EscapeReabsorbed`, `InternalInclusionViaCoding`,
      `CodingInternalAccuracy`, `DiagonalEliminator`, and
      `ChiEqMInternal`.

      It also proves:

        coding_soundness_from_accuracy_and_inclusion

      This lemma recovers the previous forward-soundness shape from
      `CodingInternalAccuracy` and `regulator_theory_included`.

    L002_01__Mirror_Unrefutability.v

      Grouped operational core file. It proves `mirror_unrefutability_core`,
      the two-hypothesis load-bearing kernel, `mirror_unrefutability`, the
      public full-interface wrapper, `self_evaluation_one_zero_excluded`,
      the L001-backed mirror-diagonal construction endpoints, and
      `regulator_non_escape`.

      The L001-backed endpoints are:

        chi_eq_m_internal_from_l001_fixed_point
        l001_constructs_chi_eq_m_internal
        mirror_unrefutability_from_l001_evaluation

      The file discharges `ChiEqMInternal` from an L001 closure-level
      negation fixed point. It does not derive `ChiEqMInternal` from H1-H4.

    L002_02__Recursive_Approximation.v

      Abstract model layer. It defines model-indexed derivability,
      `AsIFFor`, compatibility `ModelAdmissibility`,
      `RecursiveApproximationStructure` with fields `approximates`,
      `RecursiveDepth`, `Penalty`, `PenaltyAtDepth`, `Stable`, and `Fragmented`,
      compatibility spellings, embedding, local MP, local authority,
      escape-reabsorption interfaces, graded pressure predicates, formal
      fragmentation predicates, the operational `CounterCertificationAt`
      predicate, the depth-indexed `NestedAuthorityPressure` predicate, and
      accumulation-law interfaces. It proves:

        local_authority_counter_certification_yields_recursive_pressure
        nested_authority_pressure_increases_penalty_at_depth
        strict_depth_pressure_unbounded
        strict_depth_pressure_obstructs_stability
        nested_authority_pressure_obstructs_stability
        model_regulator_non_escape
        embedded_authority_stability_limit

    L002_03__Symbolic_Regulator_Principles.v

      Public symbolic-regulator-principle layer. It defines `Undecidable`
      and `SLambdaIncomplete`, exposes `M`-checked derivability as a closure through
      `checked_derivability_closure_modus_ponens`, proves the fixed-point
      undecidability helper `negfixp_yields_undecidable_in_m`, and proves:

        evaluation_frame_yields_undecidable_in_m
        enablement_of_falsehoods
        paradox_of_the_external
        perpetuity_of_ignorance
        impossibility_of_perfect_doubt
        incomprehensibility_of_symbolic_regulation

    L002_04__Concrete_Model_Pattern.v

      Concrete reusable model-pattern layer. It defines the one-state
      `ConcreteModel`, the distinguished `concrete_authority_formula`, the
      counter formula `concrete_counter_formula`, concrete derivability,
      `AsIF`, approximation, depth, penalty, stability, and fragmentation
      data, and packages them as `concrete_recursive_structure`.

      It proves the bridge laws for the concrete instance:

        concrete_model_local_authority
        concrete_recursive_approximation_cost
        concrete_penalty_accumulates
        concrete_recursive_approximation_depth_cost
        concrete_recursive_depth_positive_penalty
        concrete_recursive_authority_pressure
        concrete_recursive_authority_depth_pressure
        concrete_stable_requires_bounded_recursive_pressure
        concrete_counter_certification_at_authority
        concrete_nested_authority_pressure_at_authority
        concrete_authority_counter_certification_yields_recursive_pressure
        concrete_authority_penalty_increases
        concrete_unbounded_recursive_pressure
        concrete_nested_authority_pressure_obstructs_stability
        concrete_model_pattern

    L002_95_API.v

      Public import surface and contract propositions:
      `MIRROR_UNREFUTABILITY_CORE_CONTRACT`,
