      certified_incomprehensibility_of_symbolic_regulation_contract
      certified_symbolic_regulator_principles_contract
      certified_symbolic_regulation_contract
      symbolic_regulation_qed


7 - Notes
    -----

    Relation to the source Symbolic Regulation text:

      The older prose version talks about provability predicates and mirror
      equivalence. L002 does not introduce a `Bew` predicate and no longer
      treats equivalence as the explanatory primitive. It uses M001 checked
      derivability as the proof-certificate layer and `AsIF` as the authority
      surface.

      The current L002 architecture replaces mirror equivalence as the
      explanatory primitive with authority: `AsIF`, `LocalAuthority`, `Escape`,
      `EscapeReabsorbed`, `regulator_non_escape`, and the recursive-pressure
      layer are the center. The original full-interface theorem still takes
      `code_Slambda_derives` and `chi_eq` as explicit Pi-quantified compatibility
      parameters. The L001-backed construction layer now constructs an
      existential `chi_eq` with the M-side Curry property, but it does not
      construct `code_Slambda_derives` and does not prove that H1-H4 entail
      `ChiEqMInternal`.

      The core theorem proves the unrefutability endpoint from the proof-minimal
      M-side assumptions. The public wrapper records the compatibility mirror
      interface while preserving that load-bearing structure. The documentary
      hypotheses do not entail the load-bearing hypothesis; they are
      compatibility declarations only.

      The formal counterpart of the prose "mistake" is
      `local_authority_counter_certification_yields_recursive_pressure`:
      local authority plus a counter-certification attempt yields local
      derivability together with nested recursive pressure. It does not assert
      semantic truth, metaphysical falsity, phenomenology, or collapse to `Bot`.

      `L002_04__Concrete_Model_Pattern` shows that this is not only an
      abstract theorem schema. In the concrete one-state instance,
      `concrete_authority_counter_certification_yields_recursive_pressure`
      turns the authority formula plus its counter-certification witness into
      nested authority pressure, `concrete_authority_penalty_increases` proves
      finite-depth growth, and
      `concrete_nested_authority_pressure_obstructs_stability` proves the
      unbounded-depth obstruction to stable continuation.

      Examples such as "seeing red" or vivid experience are interpretation
      prose for possible readings of nested authority pressure. They are not
      formal vocabulary in L002 unless a later package introduces a separate
      phenomenology layer.

    L002 has no extraction surface at this stage. Its artifacts are assumption
    reports showing that the theorem, public contract, and package witness are
    closed under the global context.
